      "q": "استعمل المعادلة المصفوفية لحل نظام المعادلتين الآتي: <br><span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">x + 2y = 9</span> <br><span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">3x - y = 6</span>.",
      "ans": "1) نكتب النظام بالصورة المصفوفية AX = B:\n   [[1, 2], [3, -1]] · [[x], [y]] = [[9], [6]].\n2) نوجد |A| والنظير الضربي <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span>:\n   |A| = 1(-1) - 2(3) = -1 - 6 = -7.\n   <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span> = (-1/7) · [[-1, -2], [-3, 1]] = [[1/7, 2/7], [3/7, -1/7]].\n3) نحسب مصفوفة المتغيرات X = <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span>B:\n   [[x], [y]] = [[1/7, 2/7], [3/7, -1/7]] · [[9], [6]]\n   x = (1/7)(9) + (2/7)(6) = (9 + 12)/7 = 21/7 = 3.\n   y = (3/7)(9) + (-1/7)(6) = (27 - 6)/7 = 21/7 = 3.\nإذن حل النظام هو (3, 3).",
      "explanation": "1) نكتب النظام بالصورة المصفوفية AX = B:\n   [[1, 2], [3, -1]] · [[x], [y]] = [[9], [6]].\n2) نوجد |A| والنظير الضربي <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span>:\n   |A| = 1(-1) - 2(3) = -1 - 6 = -7.\n   <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span> = (-1/7) · [[-1, -2], [-3, 1]] = [[1/7, 2/7], [3/7, -1/7]].\n3) نحسب مصفوفة المتغيرات X = <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">A</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">-1</span></span></span>B:\n   [[x], [y]] = [[1/7, 2/7], [3/7, -1/7]] · [[9], [6]]\n   x = (1/7)(9) + (2/7)(6) = (9 + 12)/7 = 21/7 = 3.\n   y = (3/7)(9) + (-1/7)(6) = (27 - 6)/7 = 21/7 = 3.\nإذن حل النظام هو (3, 3).",
