      "lessonNumber": "4-5",
      "lessonTitle": "الأسس النسبية",
      "q": "بسط المقدار الآتي مع إنطاق المقام بحيث لا يظهر أي أس نسبي في المقام: <br><span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-frac\"><span class=\"sec-num\">6</span><span class=\"sec-den\">x<span class=\"sec-pow\">3/7</span></span></span></span>.",
      "ans": "1) نحدد الأس اللازم لجعل أس المقام عدداً صحيحاً:\n   1 - 3/7 = 4/7.\n2) نضرب كلاً من البسط والمقام في <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>:\n   = [6 · <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>] / [<span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">3/7</span></span></span> · <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>].\n3) نبسط المقام بجمع الأسس: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">3/7 + 4/7</span></span></span> = <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">7/7</span></span></span> = x¹ = x.\n4) الناتج النهائي في أبسط صورة:\n   = (<span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">6x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>) / x.",
      "explanation": "1) نحدد الأس اللازم لجعل أس المقام عدداً صحيحاً:\n   1 - 3/7 = 4/7.\n2) نضرب كلاً من البسط والمقام في <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>:\n   = [6 · <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>] / [<span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">3/7</span></span></span> · <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>].\n3) نبسط المقام بجمع الأسس: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">3/7 + 4/7</span></span></span> = <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">7/7</span></span></span> = x¹ = x.\n4) الناتج النهائي في أبسط صورة:\n   = (<span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"sec-pow\"><span class=\"sec-base\">6x</span><span class=\"sec-exp\">4/7</span></span></span>) / x.",
