      "q": "إذا كانت <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">A = <span class=\"sec-brack\">[</span> <span class=\"sec-row\">2 &nbsp; -1</span> , <span class=\"sec-row\">3 &nbsp; 4</span> <span class=\"sec-brack\">]</span></span> و <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">B = <span class=\"sec-brack\">[</span> <span class=\"sec-row\">1 &nbsp; 0</span> , <span class=\"sec-row\">-2 &nbsp; 3</span> <span class=\"sec-brack\">]</span></span>، فاحسب حاصل الضرب <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">AB</span> وحاصل الضرب <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">BA</span>، وماذا تستنتج؟",
      "ans": "1) حساب AB:\n   الصف 1: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">c<span class=\"sec-sub\">11</span></span> = 2(1) + (-1)(-2) = 2 + 2 = 4، <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">c<span class=\"sec-sub\">12</span></span> = 2(0) + (-1)(3) = -3.\n   الصف 2: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">c<span class=\"sec-sub\">21</span></span> = 3(1) + 4(-2) = 3 - 8 = -5، <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">c<span class=\"sec-sub\">22</span></span> = 3(0) + 4(3) = 12.\n   إذن AB = [[4, -3], [-5, 12]].\n2) حساب BA:\n   الصف 1: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">d<span class=\"sec-sub\">11</span></span> = 1(2) + 0(3) = 2، <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">d<span class=\"sec-sub\">12</span></span> = 1(-1) + 0(4) = -1.\n   الصف 2: <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">d<span class=\"sec-sub\">21</span></span> = (-2)(2) + 3(3) = -4 + 9 = 5، <span class=\"sec-math ltr-math\" dir=\"ltr\">d<span class=\"sec-sub\">22</span></span> = (-2)(-1) + 3(4) = 2 + 12 = 14.\n   إذن BA = [[2, -1], [5, 14]].\n3) الاستنتاج: نلاحظ أن AB ≠ BA، مما يؤكد أن ضرب المصفوفات ليس إبدالياً.",
